    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d936-a9">

                <pb facs="1092" n="996" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg996"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic">July 27,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>About 1,600 Spanish sailors held at Portsmouth, N. H., as prisoners of war will
                    be allowed to return to Spain on parole if Spanish Government will send neutral
                    ship for them. Make proposal through the usual channel.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
